KEY,VARIABLE,SHEET,DATATYPE,MEASUREMENTLVL,REFERENCE,DEFINITION,Status,NVIVO,UNIT
ADJUSTMENTS.2006_Guide,2006_Guide,Adjustments,,,FINE.2006_Guide,,,,
ADJUSTMENTS.Abs_Benefit,Abs_Benefit,Adjustments,Integer,Continuous,,The percentage with which the Commission has reduced the fine on the grounds that the legal entity has not benefitted from the infringement,Observed,1. Fine calculation\Attenuating circumstances\Absence of benefit,Undertaking
ADJUSTMENTS.Abs_Coercion,Abs_Coercion,Adjustments,Integer,Continuous,,The percentage with which the Commission has reduced the fine on the grounds that the legal entity has not coerced other undertakings into participating in the infringement,Observed,1. Fine calculation\Attenuating circumstances\Absence of coercion,Undertaking
ADJUSTMENTS.Abs_Instigation,Abs_Instigation,Adjustments,Integer,Continuous,,The percentage with which the Commission has reduced the fine on the grounds that the legal entity was not an instigator of the infringement,Observed,1. Fine calculation\Attenuating circumstances\Absence of instigation,Undertaking
ADJUSTMENTS.Abs_Ringleader,Abs_Ringleader,Adjustments,Integer,Continuous,,The percentage with which the Commission has reduced the fine on the grounds that the legal entity was not a ring leader in a cartel infringement,Observed,1. Fine calculation\Attenuating circumstances\Absence of ringleadership,Undertaking
ADJUSTMENTS.Ag_Tot,Ag_Tot,Adjustments,Integer,Continuous,,The total percentage of increases imposed on the basis of aggravating circumstances,Derived,,Undertaking
ADJUSTMENTS.At_Ag,At_Ag,Adjustments,Integer,Continuous,,"The total percentage of reduction (or increase) granted (or imposed) on the basis of attenuating/mitigating and aggravating circumstances. The percentage is calculated by subtracting 'ADJUSTMENTS.At_Tot' from 'ADJUSTMENTS.Ag_Tot'. Therefore, a negative value reflects a total reduction after taking into account mitigating/attenuating and aggravating circumstances, while a positive value reflects a total increase after taking into account mitigating/attenuating and aggravating circumstances.",Derived,,Undertaking
ADJUSTMENTS.At_Tot,At_Tot,Adjustments,Integer,Continuous,,The total percentage of reduction granted on the basis of attenuating/mitigating circumstances,Derived,,Undertaking
ADJUSTMENTS.Case,Case,Adjustments,,,MAIN.Case,,,,
ADJUSTMENTS.Coercion_Act,Coercion_Act,Adjustments,Integer,Continuous,,The percentage with which the Commission has increased the fine on the grounds that the legal entity coerced other parties into the anticompetitive conduct,Observed,1. Fine calculation\Aggravating circumstances\Coercion,Undertaking
ADJUSTMENTS.Coercion_Pass,Coercion_Pass,Adjustments,Integer,Continuous,,The percentage with which the Commission has reduced the fine on the grounds that the legal entity was coerced into participation by another party to the infringement,Observed,1. Fine calculation\Attenuating circumstances\Coercion,Undertaking
ADJUSTMENTS.Compliance,Compliance,Adjustments,Integer,Continuous,,The percentage with which the Commission has reduced the fine on the grounds that the legal entity has introduced a competition law compliance program,Observed,1. Fine calculation\Attenuating circumstances\Compliance,Undertaking
ADJUSTMENTS.Continuation,Continuation,Adjustments,Integer,Continuous,,The percentage with which the Commission has increased the fine on the grounds that the legal entity has continued its anticompetitive conduct after the Commission has ordered it to stop.,Observed,1. Fine calculation\Aggravating circumstances\Continuation after inspection,Undertaking
ADJUSTMENTS.Coop_Outside,Coop_Outside,Adjustments,Integer,Continuous,,The percentage with which the Commission has reduced the fine on the grounds that the legal entity has cooperated with the commission beyond its legal obligations to do so and outside the framework of the Leniency Notice.,Observed,1. Fine calculation\Attenuating circumstances\Cooperation outside leniency,Undertaking
ADJUSTMENTS.Coordination,Coordination,Adjustments,Integer,Continuous,,T